Date: Thu, 12 Feb 2026 13:10:32 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] multi-vendor: Add QCA SMD Capabilities and Policy Config
 TLVs

Add QCA vendor-specific TLVs for Seamless Mobility Domain support:
- SMD Capabilities TLV (0x0002) for agent capability reporting
- SMD Policy Config TLV (0x0003) for controller policy configuration

Includes YAML definitions, SEND/RECEIVE handlers, and conditional
registration based on BEEROCKS_CONTROLLER define.

Signed-off-by: Vignesh Sridharan <vignsrid@qti.qualcomm.com>
